 "_readme": "Prompt words for the idea generators. Every word was picked from the text of the 2010 book or the 2025 V2 comp (Mark's direction, 2026-11-02), not invented. `npm run check` confirms each word still appears in source/ when that folder exists. Mark reviews. The lists are far shorter than the brief's 300 per list because the book does not contain that many concrete words; add more only with Mark's say-so. `mass` lists nouns that take no article (coffee, not a coffee). Constraints are phrases built on a word the book uses (`word`); eras are decades and the future.",
